<div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">SMALL BUSINESS. MORE CONNECTED.</p><h1 id="hero-title">Your business.<br/><em>Right at home.</em></h1><p class="lead">Custom apps for small businesses.<br/>Built and hosted by Tide Casa.</p><p class="intro">Customer rewards that give people a reason to return. Your menu, orders, team and events, together in one easy mobile app. Thoughtfully built by real people, around the way you work.</p><div class="actions"><span class="home-cta-pair"><a class="button outline" href="/book-a-demo">Book a demo</a><a class="button" href="/purchase/business">Buy now</a></span><a class="text-link" href="#pricing">One simple price</a></div><p class="keep-site"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> Keep your website. We build and host your app.</p></div>
