<section class="features wrap" id="included" aria-labelledby="features-title">
<p class="eyebrow centered">WHAT’S INCLUDED</p><div class="feature-heading"><h2 id="features-title">A <em>smoother</em> day.</h2><p>More reasons to return.<br/>Little tools that work together.</p></div>
<div class="feature-list">
<article class="feature-row"><div class="feature-copy"><p class="feature-label">CUSTOMER REWARDS</p><h3>Give them a reason to return. <span class="heart" aria-label="love">♥</span></h3><p>Choose rewards that fit your business: buy nine, get the tenth free, or a treat for reaching a monthly visit goal. You choose the item, visit goal and reward.</p></div><div class="mini-ui" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative owner-chosen reward: nine coffees collected toward a free tenth coffee"><span class="ui-label">A LITTLE THANK-YOU</span><div class="points"><strong>9</strong><span>coffees collected</span><span class="heart" aria-hidden="true">♥</span></div><div class="points-track"><span style="width:90%"></span></div><span>Your tenth coffee is a gift.</span></div></article>
<article class="feature-row"><div class="feature-copy"><p class="feature-label">MENU DISPLAY</p><h3>A menu that feels like you.</h3><p>Show your menu with your own photos, descriptions, prices and specials. A familiar place for customers to find their next favorite.</p></div><div class="mini-ui" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative menu listing with a description and price"><span class="ui-label">ON YOUR MENU</span><strong>Your signature dish</strong><span>A great photo. A clear description.<br/>Everything they need to choose.</span><div class="ui-divider"></div><span class="ui-footer">Your photos <span>Your prices</span></span></div></article>
<article class="feature-row"><div class="feature-copy"><p class="feature-label">ORDERING, DELIVERY &amp; PAYMENTS</p><h3>From their order to your door.</h3><p>Manage menu orders, pickup and your own delivery workflow. Restaurant customer-payment checkout is currently disabled; Tide Casa app setup and maintenance billing are available separately.</p></div><div class="mini-ui" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative order summary with pickup; restaurant payment checkout is currently disabled"><span class="ui-label">YOUR CUSTOMER’S ORDER</span><strong>Two favorites. One order.</strong><span>Items, customer details and notes.<br/>Together for your team.</span><span class="ui-status">Pickup · Delivery · Payments not enabled</span></div></article>
<article class="feature-row"><div class="feature-copy"><p class="feature-label">EMPLOYEE SCHEDULES, MESSAGES &amp; REWARDS</p><h3>Everyone on the same page.</h3><p>Keep schedules and private team conversations close at hand. Recognize your employees with rewards you choose, alongside the details they need for their next shift.</p></div><div class="mini-ui" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative private team messages about tomorrow’s schedule"><span class="ui-label">TEAM CHAT</span><div class="chat-bubble"><strong>Team update</strong><span>Tomorrow’s schedule is ready.</span></div><div class="chat-bubble reply">Got it. See you at 9!</div></div></article>
<article class="feature-row"><div class="feature-copy"><p class="feature-label">EMPLOYEE ONBOARDING VIDEO COURSES</p><h3>A thoughtful first day.</h3><p>Share onboarding video courses for new employees. Keep your welcome, workplace guidance and training in one place, ready when each person starts.</p></div><div class="mini-ui edit-ui" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative employee onboarding course list"><span class="ui-label">WELCOME TO THE TEAM</span><div><span>Your first shift</span><span>Video</span></div><div><span>Getting to know the menu</span><span>Video</span></div><div><span>How we care for guests</span><span>Video</span></div></div></article>
<article class="feature-row"><div class="feature-copy"><p class="feature-label">LIVE EVENTS &amp; RSVP</p><h3>Give them a date to look forward to.</h3><p>Share live events, their details and a way for guests to RSVP. Bring your upcoming plans and guest responses together.</p></div><div class="mini-ui" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative live event with RSVP and guest list"><span class="ui-label">COMING UP</span><strong>Live music.<br/>This Friday.</strong><div class="share-options"><span>Event details</span><span>RSVP</span><span>Guest list</span></div></div></article>
</div><p class="features-note">Illustrative tools shown. After payment, we confirm the features and content that fit your business.<br/>Restaurant payment checkout and phone notification sending are currently disabled. Tide Casa setup and maintenance billing are available separately.<br/>Custom integrations and any outside service costs are agreed separately.</p>
