<section class="human wrap" id="process" aria-labelledby="human-title">
<div class="human-copy"><p class="eyebrow">PEOPLE FIRST. FROM DAY ONE.</p><h2 id="human-title">Your idea.<br/>Our hands.<br/><em>Built together.</em></h2><p>Tell us what a better day looks like for your business. We’ll help you choose the right tools, bring in your photos and details, and make it feel like you.</p><p class="build-time"><strong>30 calendar days to build and review</strong><br/>after your initial payment is confirmed.</p></div>
<ol class="steps"><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Tell us about your business.</h3><p>After payment, create your account and share your services, photos and goals. We confirm your app’s scope together.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>We build. You have a say.</h3><p>Real people create and review your app. You approve it with us before launch.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>Open the door. Keep it fresh.</h3><p>Share your link or QR. Customers can add the app to their home screen. Use your own login for everyday updates.</p></div></li></ol>
</section>
